# rena0-guard-hold — F1-3 fixture
# Expectations cite the guard state and its drain: FighterState::Guard is the port's
# state 6 (fighter.h:74-95) and the guard edge is MatchFrame::guardStarted (match.h:142).
# On the pilot path the unified meter drains the recovered -10/tick
# (guard_native_control.hpp:38-42), so a full second of held guard costs 100 of 1000 and
# exhaustion lands at tick 99; the port has no guard phases, so the drain runs every
# Guard tick (named limit).
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
input 0 GUARD
expect 0 guard_started 1
expect 0 stamina 99
expect 5 state_enum 6
expect 59 stamina 40
expect 59 dummy_static 1
expect 99 guard_exhausted 1
